<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Atlas CDMX - Metodologia</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #f3efe6;
      --paper: #fffdf7;
      --ink: #1f2933;
      --muted: #5b6470;
      --line: #d7d0c2;
      --accent: #0f766e;
      --accent-2: #9a3412;
      --mono: "IBM Plex Mono", "SFMono-Regular", Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
      --sans: "IBM Plex Sans", "Avenir Next", "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--ink);
      font-family: var(--sans);
      background:
        radial-gradient(1200px 500px at 5% -20%, #eadfc8 0%, transparent 60%),
        radial-gradient(900px 400px at 100% 0%, #d8e7e2 0%, transparent 65%),
        var(--bg);
    }

    .wrap {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 24px;
      display: grid;
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .hero, .panel {
      background: var(--paper);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 16px 18px;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 0 0 6px;
      font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 2.2vw, 1.9rem);
      letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    }

    .sub {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    .actions {
      margin-top: 12px;
      display: flex;
      gap: 8px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--ink);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 7px 11px;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      background: #fff;
    }

    .btn:hover {
      border-color: var(--accent);
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    .grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .step {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: #fff;
      padding: 12px;
      display: grid;
      gap: 6px;
    }

    .step h2 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 0.98rem;
    }

    .step p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      line-height: 1.35;
    }

    .k {
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--accent-2);
      white-space: nowrap;
      overflow: hidden;
      text-overflow: ellipsis;
    }

    .folder {
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
    }

    .folder a {
      color: var(--accent);
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .folder a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

    table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    th, td {
      text-align: left;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding: 8px 6px;
      vertical-align: top;
    }

    th {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    }

    .note {
      font-size: 0.86rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin: 8px 0 0;
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="wrap">
    <section class="hero">
      <h1>Atlas CDMX: Metodologia del Pipeline</h1>
      <p class="sub">
        Version enfocada en metodologia (pasos 0-8) y conexiones vigentes de Google Drive.
      </p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="btn" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1T4irjWUR94Gs-R9X51J4TvW7qDcZF3gD?usp=sharing">Abrir Drive (raiz)</a>
        <a class="btn" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="../README.md">Ver README</a>
        <a class="btn" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="./logica_y_huecos_cadena_tesis.txt">Ver documento logico (TXT)</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="panel">
      <h2 style="margin:0 0 10px;">Pasos Metodologicos</h2>
      <div class="grid">
        <article class="step">
          <h2>Paso 0 - Calibracion Ta</h2>
          <p>Regresion LST - Ta con estaciones RedMet en GEE.</p>
          <div class="k">code/pipeline/step_0_calibration/gee_calibrate_ta_coefficients.js</div>
          <div class="folder">Drive: <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1gygjp9aq-62RLf5pjSC24QFaAhlNnj2a">step_0_calibration</a></div>
        </article>

        <article class="step">
          <h2>Paso 1 - Climatologia Termica</h2>
          <p>Exporta LST, Ta, UHI, NDVI, NDBI y Albedo (2014-2024).</p>
          <div class="k">code/pipeline/step_1_thermal_rasters/gee_landsat_thermal_climatology.js</div>
          <div class="folder">Drive: <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1XzzhfaR-Sr_GVEzDMFQRYnchxhs1Yq6Q">step_1_thermal_rasters</a></div>
        </article>

        <article class="step">
          <h2>Paso 2 - Zonal Stats + IVS</h2>
          <p>Integra raster a manzana + indicadores sociales + alcaldia.</p>
          <div class="k">extract_raster_stats.py -> generate_ivs.py -> add_alcaldia.py</div>
          <div class="folder">Drive: <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1HSYHMCTelnNFxj8DZ-WpvtHRwMXTZxud">step_2_manzanas_ivs</a></div>
        </article>

        <article class="step">
          <h2>Paso 3 - Merge GWR</h2>
          <p>Integra coeficientes MGWR de 16 alcaldias al master citywide.</p>
          <div class="k">code/pipeline/step_3_gwr/merge_gwr_coefficients.py</div>
          <div class="folder">Drive: <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1UYRE3o_nzys26MH2mAWSsr8UEb63FiQm">step_3_gwr</a></div>
        </article>

        <article class="step">
          <h2>Paso 4 - Space Matrix</h2>
          <p>Calcula FSI, GSI, L, OSR desde catastro y huellas.</p>
          <div class="k">stitch_citywide_catastro.py -> batch_space_matrix.py -> calculate_space_matrix.py</div>
          <div class="folder">Drive: <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1veNOO8evqddyNWqU8mssvye2rTiliBoy">step_4_space_matrix</a></div>
        </article>

        <article class="step">
          <h2>Paso 5 - Hotspots + Merge</h2>
          <p>Clasificacion termico-social (26/28 C) y consolidacion final.</p>
          <div class="k">create_hotspots_gwr.py -> merge_thermal_gwr_sm.py</div>
          <div class="folder">Drive: <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1juAgvGM-5gXCsP3YQFVDXg8KmmlWgQPq">step_5_hotspots</a></div>
        </article>

        <article class="step">
          <h2>Paso 6 - Tipologias</h2>
          <p>Clasifica tipologias morfologicas de Space Matrix.</p>
          <div class="k">code/pipeline/step_6_typologies/classify_spacematrix_typology.py</div>
          <div class="folder">Drive: sin carpeta propia (se guarda dentro de <strong>step_5_hotspots</strong>).</div>
        </article>

        <article class="step">
          <h2>Paso 7 - Space Syntax</h2>
          <p>Agrega NAIN/NACH a manzanas hotspot por radio.</p>
          <div class="k">code/pipeline/step_7_space_syntax/aggregate_syntax_to_hotspots.py</div>
          <div class="folder">Drive: <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1nHSb2henaBf9Fc_rsRQtgTwf8C4Z4Lhb">step_7_space_syntax</a></div>
        </article>

        <article class="step">
          <h2>Paso 8 - Priorizacion</h2>
          <p>Ranking final de manzanas y zonas de estudio.</p>
          <div class="k">code/pipeline/step_8_prioritization/prioritize_study_zones.py</div>
          <div class="folder">Drive: <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1vJMoJqYRQpOYWtdE5FjYSAKguLw7UAZ-">step_8_prioritization</a></div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="panel">
      <h2 style="margin:0 0 10px;">Conexiones Drive (actualizadas)</h2>
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Carpeta</th>
            <th>ID</th>
            <th>Link</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Raiz data</td><td class="k">1T4irjWUR94Gs-R9X51J4TvW7qDcZF3gD</td><td><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1T4irjWUR94Gs-R9X51J4TvW7qDcZF3gD?usp=sharing">Abrir</a></td></tr>
          <tr><td>boundaries</td><td class="k">1jxH9zAkyHDPbcFvXMEMEE9hCO2uZApLy</td><td><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1jxH9zAkyHDPbcFvXMEMEE9hCO2uZApLy">Abrir</a></td></tr>
          <tr><td>step_0_calibration</td><td class="k">1gygjp9aq-62RLf5pjSC24QFaAhlNnj2a</td><td><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1gygjp9aq-62RLf5pjSC24QFaAhlNnj2a">Abrir</a></td></tr>
          <tr><td>step_1_thermal_rasters</td><td class="k">1XzzhfaR-Sr_GVEzDMFQRYnchxhs1Yq6Q</td><td><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1XzzhfaR-Sr_GVEzDMFQRYnchxhs1Yq6Q">Abrir</a></td></tr>
          <tr><td>step_2_manzanas_ivs</td><td class="k">1HSYHMCTelnNFxj8DZ-WpvtHRwMXTZxud</td><td><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1HSYHMCTelnNFxj8DZ-WpvtHRwMXTZxud">Abrir</a></td></tr>
          <tr><td>step_3_gwr</td><td class="k">1UYRE3o_nzys26MH2mAWSsr8UEb63FiQm</td><td><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1UYRE3o_nzys26MH2mAWSsr8UEb63FiQm">Abrir</a></td></tr>
          <tr><td>step_4_space_matrix</td><td class="k">1veNOO8evqddyNWqU8mssvye2rTiliBoy</td><td><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1veNOO8evqddyNWqU8mssvye2rTiliBoy">Abrir</a></td></tr>
          <tr><td>step_5_hotspots</td><td class="k">1juAgvGM-5gXCsP3YQFVDXg8KmmlWgQPq</td><td><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1juAgvGM-5gXCsP3YQFVDXg8KmmlWgQPq">Abrir</a></td></tr>
          <tr><td>step_7_space_syntax</td><td class="k">1nHSb2henaBf9Fc_rsRQtgTwf8C4Z4Lhb</td><td><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1nHSb2henaBf9Fc_rsRQtgTwf8C4Z4Lhb">Abrir</a></td></tr>
          <tr><td>step_8_prioritization</td><td class="k">1vJMoJqYRQpOYWtdE5FjYSAKguLw7UAZ-</td><td><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1vJMoJqYRQpOYWtdE5FjYSAKguLw7UAZ-">Abrir</a></td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <p class="note">
        Nota: no existe carpeta <code>step_6_typologies</code>; las tipologias se almacenan como layers en los outputs de <code>step_5_hotspots</code>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
